  "description": {
   "en": "An ordinary high school student, Yumeji Kotaki, is transferred to his class by his childhood friend, Chieri Omine, who has grown to 8 meters in height! Yumeji is assigned as \"caretaker\" to support Chieri's school life. Their daily life is full of excitement due to the height difference! The height difference is nothing to worry about!",
   "ja": "普通の高校生・小滝夢路のクラスに転校してきたのは、身長が8メートルに巨大化した幼馴染・大峰ちえりだった！ちえりの学校生活のサポートをする「お手伝いさん」を任された夢路。身長差がある二人の日常はドキドキがいっぱいで!?　高低差もなんのその！",
   "pt-br": "Uma aluna transferida que tem 8 metros de altura...?! \nAmigos de infância se reencontram, mas nem tudo é como antes… Uma mudança na relação entre Chieri e Yumeji, acompanhe o desenrolar desta comédia romântica gigantesca."
  },
